<title>FINLAND: Enso 1996 sales, op profit by division.</title>
<headline>Enso 1996 sales, op profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group Enso Oy gave on Monday the following breakdown of net sales and operating profit by division (million markka):</p>
<p> NET SALES				  1996		1995</p>
<p> Base industries			 5,727	     6,468</p>
<p> Packaging boards			7,142	     7,286</p>
<p> Fine papers			     6,865	     8,273</p>
<p> Publication papers		    7,482	     7,970</p>
<p> Forest chemicals			  676		 821</p>
<p> Marketing and other companies     1,177	     1,024</p>
<p> Internal sales			 -3,409	    -3,816</p>
<p> TOTAL				    25,660	    28,026</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT			 1996		1995</p>
<p> Base industries			   256	     1,082</p>
<p> Packaging boards			  984	     1,294</p>
<p> Fine papers				 -61	     1,263</p>
<p> Publication papers		    1,268	     1,101</p>
<p> Forest chemicals			  111		 107</p>
<p> Other activities and eliminations   147		  86</p>
<p> TOTAL				     2,706	     4,933</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
